{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/21ce90d3b45209ac6f7a4b579ef8628e.avif?t=1773861210\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are dozens of weapons that you'll need to master to survive in combat.\u00a0 Each weapon comes with their own unique move list and mechanics.\u00a0 <br><br>Throw and recall the giant Great Sword to extend combos, gain armor with the Warhammer, or teleport for quick counter-hits with the Light Dagger.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/08d37b7a28c6da6b64f615649fd3d1a7.poster.avif?t=1773861210\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/08d37b7a28c6da6b64f615649fd3d1a7.webm?t=1773861210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/2b9101127d954a83d98845a6d116f05c.avif?t=1773861210\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge the land to find valuable loot and gear.\u00a0 You'll need this items for quests, crafting, and to sell on the market.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/0102efe95aa4bc8ad5170a1f7a6ef47b.poster.avif?t=1773861210\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/0102efe95aa4bc8ad5170a1f7a6ef47b.webm?t=1773861210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/ebbd314d03b55d86e064f5900b7e8e4b.avif?t=1773861210\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you've gathered your loot you'll need to extract from the map.\u00a0 Be careful though, if you die on the map you'll lose everything you found!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/26ada5a826aac444a1b7511b112e5e54.poster.avif?t=1773861210\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/26ada5a826aac444a1b7511b112e5e54.webm?t=1773861210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/7efea652ce54e48a57630794d9873404.avif?t=1773861210\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your hideout using materials and loot you've found in each raid.\u00a0 This will unlock new weapons, stronger armor and customizable helmets.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/5d6dd1a412fbe01245b5c739ee70c2b1.poster.avif?t=1773861210\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/5d6dd1a412fbe01245b5c739ee70c2b1.webm?t=1773861210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/ba085e600af3078edbd2c409a9c4d58c.avif?t=1773861210\" width=600 height=90 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mastering your weapon, finding loot, extracting, and upgrading your base leads to one goal.\u00a0 Take out the gangs ruling the city and become the best bounty hunter in Nexus-8!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/d7721f7a26121ce73a9e8f128d90ceec.poster.avif?t=1773861210\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/extras/d7721f7a26121ce73a9e8f128d90ceec.webm?t=1773861210\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3366750?t=1773861210","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3366750?t=1773861210","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/9b03e2381715ef5a8c6f5cd2572aa0a481a6a553/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1773861210","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3366750/9b03e2381715ef5a8c6f5cd2572aa0a481a6a553/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1773861210","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\